  <item>
    <title>04. 三两页书朋友们的女性主题书单</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680a55287a449ae858827da0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680a55287a449ae858827da0</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Apr 2025 15:31:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期来报刊亭的播客录音稍微有些特别，是我们在一个叫做「三两页书」的读书活动上进行了一场女性主题书籍的分享活动。</span></p><span></span><p><span>三两页书是我们从2024年10月中旬开始组织的一个比较自由散漫随意的读书聚会，每两周一次，在周二的晚上进行。在三月妇女节的时候，我们第一次改变了一下常规自由阅读和交流的形式，做了一次主题的分享，我们依然是没有限定任何书的类型、语言、作者等等，但我们给了大家一个小小的命题——女性主题，它可以是女性为主角的作品，也可以是女性作家的作品，也可以是讨论女性议题的作品。</span></p><span></span><p><span>通过每个人不同角度的分享，我们听到了非常多的女性主题作品，也看到了大家去关注到这个议题之下不同的面相。正如现场有一句被反复引用的话，女人的问题可能很多时候就是人的问题。所以也希望通过这次分享的录音给到大家一些小小的启发，一些新的阅读清单的更新。</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为是现场活动的录音，所以可能音质会中间有一些忽忽好忽坏，还望大家包涵。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36134999/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36134999/"><span>开场：女性学者访谈</span></a><strong><span>》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36930643/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36930643/"><span>大众文化的女性主义指南</span></a><strong><span>》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35998684/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35998684/"><span>她们和她们</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35966120/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35966120/"><span>始于极限</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/25760837/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/25760837/"><span>毒婦</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">19:45</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/26767248/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/26767248/"><span>校园秘史</span></a><span>》《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/3182667/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/3182667/"><span>异旅人</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36659710/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36659710/"><span>猫鱼</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1911">31:51</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35045641/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35045641/"><span>战争中没有女性</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">36:15</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/37119422/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/37119422/"><span>女性卫生用品的社会史</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2284">38:04</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/34983889/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/34983889/"><span>巴黎评论·女性作家访谈</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2412">40:12</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/34835082/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/34835082/"><span>一间只属于自己的房间</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36106589/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36106589/"><span>“女巫”: 不可战胜的女性</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2842">47:22</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35545272/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35545272/"><span>贪婪的多巴胺</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2984">49:44</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35942057/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35942057/"><span>看不见的女性</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3381">56:21</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36387845/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36387845/"><span>去他的父权制</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3644">1:00:44</a> 《红楼梦》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3853">1:04:13</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36020007/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36020007/"><span>暮色将尽</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4131">1:08:51</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35585201/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35585201/"><span>微尘</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4277">1:11:17</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36096287/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36096287/"><span>东京八平米</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4504">1:15:04</a></span></strong><span> 《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36831351/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36831351/"><span>献灯使</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4751">1:19:11</a> 《</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/27030380/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/27030380/"><span>记忆的性别</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>查看完整书单：</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/doulist/161117362/?start=0&amp;sort=time&amp;playable=0&amp;sub_type=" data-url="https://www.douban.com/doulist/161117362/?start=0&amp;sort=time&amp;playable=0&amp;sub_type="><span>三两页书女性主题书单2025</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>我们依然在每两周举办一次「三两页书」的读书聚会，如果你想要参加，可以添加微信（laura316605）进群</span></p>]]></description>
